      "title": "commview: fix handling of NCFX files that aren't ours.",
      "message": "commview: fix handling of NCFX files that aren't ours.\n\nIf commview_ncfx_read_header() returns WTAP_ERR_BAD_FILE, it doesn't\nmean we got an error, it means it's probably not a Commview NCFX file.\nCheck for that and, if we get it, free the error message and return\nWTAP_OPEN_NOT_MINE.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2024-08-29T15:14:04.000-07:00",
